# MOLE's OWN triangulation, cell by cell and slot by slot.
#
# Produced by MOLE 2 itself with MOLE_TETRA_DUMP=1 (ComplexComputation.cs), which
# writes one line per cell in Triangulation.Vertices order:
#     centroid.x centroid.y centroid.z  nNullAdjacency  isBoundary  volume  v0;v1;v2;v3
